    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"The primary focus of this bibliography is on scientific literature relating to marine sand and gravel, but also included are papers pertinent to beach nourishment using offshore sand sources, the distribution and evolutionary history of marine sand bodies, and selected papers on sand and gravel and marine sand bodies in other countries that have application to the U.S. The literature on this subject is extensive and diverse, and as such this report of 816 references is acknowledged to be only a partial listing of references available on the subject of marine aggregates.\"",
            "type": "abstract",
